		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Jintha'Alor is the capital of the {red:vilebranch-trolls}Vilebranch{/red} trolls. It rises in the south of the {link:the-hinterlands}Hinterlands{/link} as a great stepped city of stone, climbing terrace by terrace to an amphitheater at its summit. At the top the {link:vile-priestess-hexx}Vile Priestess Hexx{/link} holds sway, guarded by the Aman'zasi. Vessels of tainted blood stand throughout the city, and their dark power drives the Vilebranch to madness. Captives are brought here for sacrifice to {link:hakkar}Hakkar{/link}. A refuse pit full of oozes and a den of wolves wait near the top for the remains. In a cave behind the amphitheater, it is said, lies an ancient egg from the days when the trolls ruled empires.]=],
		},
	},
})

