			text = [=[Falstad Wildhammer is the High Thane of the {red:wildhammer-clan}Wildhammer{/red} dwarves. From his keep at {link:aerie-peak}Aerie Peak{/link} he rules the clan, its riders and its gryphons. He is short of patience and long of memory. He has no time for chatter while trolls press against his borders, and he says so plainly. Yet the clan's strength rests on his judgment, and every errand that reaches Aerie Peak passes first through his hall.]=],
