		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Falstad leads the only dwarven clan that does not answer to {link:magni-bronzebeard}Magni Bronzebeard{/link}. The Wildhammers are kin to {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}, and they flew beside the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} in the {link:second-war}Second War{/link}. Still, they keep their own counsel. Under Falstad, {link:aerie-peak}Aerie Peak{/link} stands alone in the hills of the trolls, and its people insist that they are no part of the Alliance. Friendship with them is not a treaty. It is a debt of deeds, earned one troll at a time.

